<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces again foiled a Hezbollah-linked bomb plot against the Homs oil refinery while Saudi Arabia and Syria signed a defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans. A Lebanese border guard killed a Syrian woman and injured her child, and a landmine blast killed two soldiers in Daraa. Israeli airstrikes continued in southern Syria, and a cleric warned that Iran plans to disrupt oil supplies, while the EU expressed a security scare in Damascus and ISIS activity persisted after the U.S. withdrawal. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQQzh3Sk1xazhoazYyUS1MTjFSdjBFZUVNcFhRdFl2SFh5QURjbHBpZEdpUlM2aURGQ0Jrcy1aMTZxem5SM3lIZHA1TldLRXFkZ3ZZNDktaTEzajRmY3hIMDRnX1RELW9FSnpaY09jR0ZSQWxjT1VPYjNHcGl6VTJySnN0VFRhSzdlQkZMag?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOV2hIV1lpekozLVd5TnIydEQwendodmUxVEp3ODA0dF90ZHY0TVhyVGx3MXNHVTRDRV9kd3l6bVlWZnJvWUR1V3ZNYmdQSHlwUU00TWYzTTBQWENrVy16b2dIaGVkRWFlR1ZpVnVsRTU3c094ajV2QW9BWUNpSk9hTXdJUUt0TnJHUUN4czhUcW5WbFQ3TjR4UmlaZnE2SjdTSFg1aDhKNE40WFdsVHVHalQyT1FCV19PbTk1RlNsaU52UHp2OHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOTXVfbWVDb25CQTZpOE5PN1dXWWxlZk50aXlqUG1FVHdOc2w2RzBkQnZrZFlEU3JoOWxtVXRKWHFKWU41WHVFOTh2aHZJVy1BQ2p3c3pQU2dKMWdZM0VKSUJuWkh6eEt0WGlpNHpWVW1TSHlQRm9lMkh3SGd5T1VpQzZmMDEtUU9yQ3dZc3RwM2ltRjU5dnA4Q3V6VDRyNW14V2FZRk0xRmN4Tmlnc25BWURWWkFHMEh5cUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Intelligence Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht